title: "10 — SRM modal identification (RTSfreerun)"
description: "The L1-SRM HSTS suspension identified through its real production damping loops on the compiled RTSfreerun twin: one Pintelon–Schoukens multisine per DoF recovers the open-loop coupled plant, and a rank-1 joint MIMO modal fit returns the shared modal table with a Cramér–Rao bound. The campaign resolution is sized by the prior's ringdown, not guessed."
